# Tote has no secrets or remote services. Its only network use is a once-a-day
# read of https://www.codewithlex.site/tote/latest.json (Settings can turn it off).
# The updater signing key lives outside the repo (%USERPROFILE%\.tauri\tote-updater.key).
# This file exists so the house rule (ship a .env.example) is visibly satisfied.
# Local build note: if the checkout path contains an apostrophe, see README
# "Building on a path with an apostrophe" for the TAURI_CONFIG override.
